"c-shiji-039-jin:m051-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m051-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m051-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m051-0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m051-0189","start":189,"end":197,"surface":"其餘不名者數十人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p054","text":"至齊，齊桓公厚禮，而以宗女妻之，有馬二十乘，重耳安之。重耳至齊二歳而桓公卒，會豎刀等爲内亂，齊孝公之立，諸侯兵數至。留齊凡五歳。重耳愛齊女，毋去心。趙衰、咎犯乃於桑下謀行。齊女侍者在桑上聞之，以告其主。其主乃殺侍者，勸重耳趣行。重耳曰：「人生安樂，孰知其他！必死於此，不能去。」齊女曰：「子一國公子，窮而來此，數士者以子爲命。子不疾反國，報勞臣，而懷女德，竊爲子羞之。且不求，何時得功？」乃與趙衰等謀，醉重耳，載以行。行遠而覺，重耳大怒，引戈欲殺咎犯。咎犯曰：「殺臣成子，偃之願也。」重耳曰：「事不成，我食舅氏之肉。」咎犯曰：「事不成，犯肉腥臊，何足食！」乃止，遂行。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"宗女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"豎刀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001123","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"齊孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001134","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"侍者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001749","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"其主","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"其主","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"侍者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001749","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0236","start":236,"end":237,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0242","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0259","start":259,"end":261,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p056","text":"去，過宋。宋襄公新困兵於楚，傷於泓，聞重耳賢，乃以國禮禮於重耳。宋司馬公孫固善於咎犯，曰：「宋小國新困，不足以求入，更之大國。」乃去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m056-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"宋襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001138","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m056-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m056-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m056-0032","start":32,"end":38,"surface":"宋司馬公孫固","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001654","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m056-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p060","text":"文公元年春，秦送重耳至河。咎犯曰：「臣從君周旋天下，過亦多矣。臣猶知之，況於君乎？請從此去矣。」重耳曰：「若反國，所不與子犯共者，河伯視之！」乃投璧河中，以與子犯盟。是時介子推從，在船中，乃笑曰：「天實開公子，而子犯以爲己功而要市於君，固足羞也。吾不忍與同位。」乃自隱渡河。秦兵圍令狐，晉軍于廬柳。二月辛丑，咎犯與秦晉大夫盟于郇。壬寅，重耳入于晉師。丙午，入于曲沃。丁未，朝于武宮，卽位爲晉君，是爲文公。群臣皆往。懷公圉奔髙梁。戊申，使人殺懷公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"子犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"介子推","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001753","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"子犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0207","start":207,"end":210,"surface":"懷公圉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000390","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m060-0220","start":220,"end":222,"surface":"懷公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000390","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p066","text":"四年，楚成王及諸侯圍宋，宋公孫固如晉告急。先軫曰：「報施定霸，於今在矣。」狐偃曰：「楚新得曹而初婚於衞，若伐曹、衞，楚必救之，則宋免矣。」於是晉作三軍。趙衰舉郤縠將中軍，郤臻佐之；使狐偃將上軍，狐毛佐之，命趙衰爲卿；欒枝將下軍，先軫佐之；荀林父御戎，魏犫爲右：往伐。冬十二月，晉兵先下山東，而以原封趙衰。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"楚成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"宋公孫固","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001654","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"三軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"郤縠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001757","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"郤臻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001758","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"狐毛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001739","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"欒枝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"魏犫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001761","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p068","text":"楚將子玉曰：「王遇晉至厚，今知楚急曹、衞而故伐之，是輕王。」王曰：「晉侯亡在外十九年，困日久矣，果得反國，險阸盡知之，能用其民，天之所開，不可當。」子玉請曰：「非敢必有功，願以閒執讒慝之口也。」楚王怒，少與之兵。於是子玉使宛春告晉：「請復衞侯而封曹，臣亦釋宋。」咎犯曰：「子玉無禮矣，君取一，臣取二，勿許。」先軫曰：「定人之謂禮。楚一言定三國，子一言而亡之，我則毋禮。不許楚，是棄宋也。不如私許曹、衞以誘之，執宛春以怒楚，旣戰而後圖之。」晉侯乃囚宛春於衞，且私許復曹、衞。曹、衞告絶於楚。楚得臣怒，撃晉師，晉師退。軍吏曰：「爲何退？」文公曰：「昔在楚，約退三舍，可倍乎！」楚師欲去，得臣不肯。四月戊辰，宋公、齊將、秦將與晉侯次城濮。己巳，與楚兵合戰，楚兵敗，得臣收餘兵去。甲午，晉師還至衡雍，作王宮于踐土。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"楚將子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"宛春","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001763","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-j