rovisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m068-0329","start":329,"end":331,"surface":"得臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p072","text":"六月，晉人復入衞侯。壬午，晉侯度河北歸國。行賞，狐偃爲首。或曰：「城濮之事，先軫之謀。」文公曰：「城濮之事，偃説我毋失信。先軫曰『軍事勝爲右』，吾用之以勝。然此一時之説，偃言萬世之功，柰何以一時之利而加萬世功乎？是以先之。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001564","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m072-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p081","text":"六年，趙衰成子、欒貞子、咎季子犯、霍伯皆卒。趙盾代趙衰執政。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"趙衰成子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"欒貞子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001767","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"咎季子犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"霍伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001768","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m081-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"執政","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","text":"初，子比自晉歸，韓宣子問叔向曰：「子比其濟乎？」對曰：「不就。」宣子曰：「同惡相求，如市賈焉，何爲不就？」對曰：「無與同好，誰與同惡？取國有五難：有寵無人，一也；有人無主，二也；有主無謀，三也；有謀而無民，四也；有民而無德，五也。子比在晉十三年矣，晉、楚之從不聞通者，可謂無人矣；族盡親叛，可謂無主矣；無釁而動，可謂無謀矣；爲羈終世，可謂無民矣；亡無愛徴，可謂無德矣。王虐而不忌，子比渉五難以弒君，誰能濟之！有楚國者，其棄疾乎？君陳、蔡，方城外屬焉。苛慝不作，盜賊伏隱，私欲不違，民無怨心。先神命之，國民信之。羋姓有亂，必季實立，楚之常也。子比之官，則右尹也；數其貴寵，則庶子也；以神所命，則又遠之；民無懷焉，將何以立？」宣子曰：「齊桓、晉文不亦是乎？」對曰：「齊桓，衞姬之子也，有寵於釐公。有鮑叔牙、賓須無、隰朋以爲輔，有莒、衞以爲外主，有髙、國以爲内主。從善如流，施惠不倦。有國，不亦宜乎？昔我文公，狐季姬之子也，有寵於獻公。好學不倦。生十七年，有士五人，有先大夫子餘、子犯以爲腹心，有魏犫、賈佗以爲股肱，有齊、宋、秦、楚以爲外主，有欒、郤、狐、先以爲内主。亡十九年，守志彌篤。惠、懷棄民，民從而與之。故文公有國，不亦宜乎？子比無施於民，無援於外，去晉，晉不送；歸楚，楚不迎。何以有國！」子比果不終焉，卒立者棄疾，如叔向言也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surfa